{"sourceUrl":"https://ifrit.caf.ac.cn/info/1041/3009.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:22.898881+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ifrit.caf.ac.cn/info/1041/3009.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span>为增进全国优秀大学生对中国林业科学研究院资源所的了解，搭建科研学术交流平台，我所</span><span><span>拟</span></span><span>定</span><span><span>于</span>2025<span>年</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>1</span></span><span>日在北京中国林业科学研究院资源信息研究所线下</span><span><span>举办</span><span>“</span><span>优秀大学生暑期夏令营</span><span>”</span><span>活动</span></span><span><span>，为期</span><span>1</span><span>天</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>一、研究所简介</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>我</span><span><span>所创建于</span>1984<span>年，是专业从事</span></span><span>林草资源与环境可持续管理和信息技术应用研究</span><span><span>的国家级社会公益性科学研究</span></span><span>机构</span><span><span>，作为国家级林业科研单位，拥有森林经理学博</span></span><span>士</span><span><span>、硕士学位授权点，</span></span><span>林学</span><span><span>博士后流动站。</span></span><span>有森林经理、林草遥感、信息技术等领域创新团队</span><span>16</span><span>个。</span><span><span>现有博士研究生导师</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span>6<span>人，硕士研究生导师</span><span>14</span><span>人，</span></span><span>具有正高级职称资格</span><span>21</span><span>人，副高级职称资格</span><span>29</span><span>人；拥有</span><span><span>中国科学院院士</span>2<span>人，</span></span><span><span>第三届全国创新争先奖状</span><span>1</span><span>人，国家“有突出贡献”中青年专家</span><span>1</span><span>人，“百千万人才工程”国家级人选</span><span>1</span><span>人，国家“万人计划”青年拔尖人才</span><span>1</span><span>人，全国林业（草）青年科技奖</span><span>5</span><span>人，“百千万人才工程”省部级人选</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>人，国家林业和草原科技创新青年拔尖人才</span><span>1</span><span>人，科技创新团队</span><span>2</span><span>个。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>二、</span></strong><strong><span>拟定</span></strong><strong><span>活动安排</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span>院所介绍及研究生培养情况介绍；</span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span></span><span>.<span>创新团队</span></span><span>专题报告</span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.</span><span>参观仪器设备、科研创新平台；</span></p>\n<p><span>4.<span>营员个人展示</span></span><span><span>（</span><span>5</span><span>分钟</span></span><span>PPT</span><span>介绍）；</span></p>\n<p><span>5.</span><span>互动交流。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>三、申请条件</span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>申请夏令营的同学须同时具备以下条件：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span></span><span>.<span>拥护中国共产党的领导，政治立场坚定，遵纪守法，品行端正，诚实守信，身心健康；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span></span><span>.<span>全国高等院校、科研院所</span><span>2026</span><span>年应届毕业生（本科及硕士研究生）；在校</span></span><span>学习成绩优秀，综合成绩排名在本专业前</span><span>30</span><span><span>%</span><span>的</span></span><span><span>优先。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span></span><span>.<span>品学兼优，英语水平较好，无补考或重修记录，未受过纪律处分；</span></span><span><span>英语四级成绩在</span><span>425</span><span>分以上，通过英语六级者优先。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4</span></span><span>.<span>具有浓厚的科研兴趣，较强的创新意识和创新能力，有志于从事</span></span><span>林草科学</span><span><span>研究</span></span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>5.</span><span>身体健康状况符合国家规定的体检标准，心理健康状况良好。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>四、</span></strong><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>《</span></span><span><span>资源所</span><span>20</span></span><span>25</span><span>年大学生暑期夏令营活动申请表</span><span><span>》</span></span><span>（见附件）；</span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>申请人个人简历</span>1<span>份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3</span><span><span>.</span><span>本科生提供大学期间前六学期</span></span><span><span>成绩单和专业排名</span></span><span>，硕士生提供硕士期间成绩单</span><span><span>（需加盖教务处</span>/<span>院</span><span>/</span><span>系公章，如因不方便盖章须先提供成绩及排名，待开学后补交加盖公章的证明材料）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4</span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>英语水平证明（如四</span>/<span>六级、雅思、</span><span>TOEFL</span><span>或</span><span>GRE/GMAT</span><span>等）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>5</span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>个人身份证明材料（包括身份证正</span>/<span>反面、学生证里</span><span>/</span><span>外面）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>6</span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>其他证明材料（能证明个人学术水平的有代表性的学术论文首页</span></span><span>及</span><span><span>各类获奖证书等）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>按照申请表、个人简历、成绩单、英语水平证明、</span></span><span>个人身份证明材料、</span><span><span>其他证明材料的顺序进行排列，整理成一个</span>PDF<span>文件（首页附材料清单）。文件命名规则：</span><span>2025</span><span>夏令营申请</span><span>+</span><span>姓名</span><span>+</span><span>学校名称。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>五</span></strong><strong><span>、报名时间及方式</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>本次</span><span><span>拟招收营员不超过</span>30<span>名</span></span><span>，</span><span><span>即日起至</span>7<span>月</span><span>28</span><span>日</span></span><span>报名</span><span><span>，将报名材料发至联系邮箱</span>zysrjc@ifrit.ac.cn<span>，邮件名称：</span><span>2025</span><span>夏令营申请</span><span>+</span><span>姓名</span><span>+</span><span>学校名称。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>六</span></strong><strong><span>、</span></strong><strong><span>入营名单</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>我所将于</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>29</span><span>日前完成入营资格审核，以电子邮件或电话</span><span><span>形式</span></span><span>通知入营人员，并将入营名单</span><span><span>在所</span></span><span>网站</span><span><span>公布</span></span><span>，未入营者不再另行通知</span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>七</span></strong><strong><span>、注意事项</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>申请材料</span></span><span>要确保真实可靠，资格审查不合格或弄虚作假者将立即取消营员资格。</span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>参加人员应遵守夏令营的安排和要求，按时参加各项活动。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span></span><span>.<span>夏令营</span></span><span>具体</span><span><span>活动安排另行</span></span><span>通知</span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4</span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>本次活动</span></span><span><span>报销往返交通费（报销标准：动车</span><span>/</span><span>高铁二等座），住宿自理</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>八</span></strong><strong><span>、</span></strong><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>联系</span><span><span>电话：</span>010-62889198</span></p>\n<p><span><span>电子邮箱：</span>zysrjc@ifrit.ac.cn</span></p>\n<p><span>地址</span><span><span>：</span></span><span>北京市</span><span><span>海淀区</span></span><span><span>东小府</span><span>1</span><span>号资源信息</span></span><span><span>研究所</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"2cf1bad9fee2c9fad309625c049baaaa8112ad5c7c8185f4ac0a674bcc4328e8","textLength":1400,"sourceSha256":"548ae9264b9bc42887c9f0dd6460ce917ea349eeab37d9f36603c32ce69f6d99","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1-申请表.docx","url":"https://ifrit.caf.ac.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1856340544&wbfileid=497CC3A42F69C3863E53CDDD07E67E76"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-b47a80265ec9f56f4512","title":"2025年中国林业科学研究院资源信息研究所关于举办“优秀大学生暑期夏令营”的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:22.898881+00:00"}
